OL,3,GNEWSASection of road to reservoir
OL,4,Aclosed for nine days
OL,5,
OL,6,FMotorists have been warned of
OL,7,Fdisruption on a key route off the Isle
OL,8,Fof Man's Mountain Road for nine days
OL,9,Fwhile a cattle grid is replaced.
OL,11,FThe closure will be in place on a
OL,12,Fsection of the A14 Tholt Y Will Road,
OL,13,Fwhich connects the A18 to the northern
OL,14,Fvillage of Sulby from 09:30 GMT on
OL,15,FMonday until 15:30 on 24 November.
OL,17,FThe Department of Infrastructure said
OL,18,Fthe road would be shut from the
OL,19,FBungalow to the Sulby Reservoir
OL,20,FEntrance.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
